WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:47.550 --> 00:01:50.350
Someone once said:

00:01:50.850 --> 00:01:57.330
There is a tree whose thick 
trunk is like a sushi roll,

00:01:57.330 --> 00:02:01.960
and when split forms thin sushi 
rolls one after another...

00:02:01.960 --> 00:02:05.870
The Rolltrunk Tree!

00:02:10.440 --> 00:02:16.240
There is a fruit full of 
fresh, deep-flavored milk

00:02:16.240 --> 00:02:20.880
blended beautifully with the 
sweet juice of peaches...

00:02:20.880 --> 00:02:25.150
The Milkypeach!

00:02:30.590 --> 00:02:34.060
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:34.060 --> 00:02:39.430
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:41.530 --> 00:02:45.610
The legendary Century Soup only 
appears once every 100 years.

00:02:45.870 --> 00:02:49.140
Toriko and a Vice-Chef of 
the Gourmet Corp., Tommyrod,

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:52.110
continued their battle to the 
death with the soup on the line.

00:02:52.710 --> 00:02:55.880
Elsewhere, Komatsu ran to get the soup,

00:02:55.880 --> 00:02:58.680
where he encountered Teppei, who 
called himself a Gourmet Reviver.

00:02:58.680 --> 00:03:02.790
But there wasn't a drop of soup 
where it was supposed to be!

00:03:03.490 --> 00:03:05.920
Tina and Zonge, who arrived next,

00:03:05.920 --> 00:03:09.290
were dumbfounded when they 
realized the situation.

00:03:10.330 --> 00:03:13.500
Also, when the Colonel realized 
that there was no soup,

00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:18.040
he left Ice Hell, abandoning 
Toriko and the others.

00:03:19.640 --> 00:03:23.640
At the same time, Coco told 
Setsuna of his prophecy

00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:26.510
that danger is closing in 
on Toriko and the others.

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:30.180
Match and Takimaru exhausted their 
strength to near death in their battles.

00:03:30.180 --> 00:03:33.620
When Toriko showed his appreciation 
of his comrades' hard work,

00:03:33.620 --> 00:03:36.250
they were enveloped with a strange sensation.

00:03:37.420 --> 00:03:40.220
Meanwhile, Tommy continues 
to use his bugs to attack

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:43.030
instead of getting his own hands dirty.

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:48.230
Toriko used shivering to 
produce a fearsome heat.

00:03:48.230 --> 00:03:51.600
Toriko's anger at Tommy is about to explode!

00:03:53.670 --> 00:03:59.340
Head-on Fight! Fierce Battle! 
Toriko vs. Tommyrod!

00:04:02.910 --> 00:04:07.120
I can finally get close to you, Tommyrod!

00:04:08.250 --> 00:04:09.950
Eat this!

00:04:09.950 --> 00:04:13.290
10-Fold Spiked Punch!

00:04:22.670 --> 00:04:24.900
Flying Fork!

00:04:34.180 --> 00:04:39.050
Just how many parasitic insects 
do you have inside your body?

00:04:40.520 --> 00:04:46.120
I wonder how many minutes you can keep 
up that childish shivering, Toriko?

00:04:46.560 --> 00:04:51.530
Normally the longest one can 
continue to shiver is 2 hours.

00:04:51.990 --> 00:04:55.160
Any longer than that and your 
muscles will stop shaking,

00:04:55.160 --> 00:04:59.430
and your body temperature will begin 
to drop, ending in your death.

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:08.280
And it's obvious that a 10,000-watt 
shivering can't last even those 2 hours!

00:05:08.640 --> 00:05:09.910
And what about you?

00:05:09.910 --> 00:05:12.980
You obviously can't give birth 
to an infinite number of insects!

00:05:13.280 --> 00:05:15.820
You must have a limit, too.

00:05:15.820 --> 00:05:22.760
I have around 10,000 eggs of 
parasitic insects inside my body.

00:05:23.060 --> 00:05:27.130
Of course, I cannot hatch 
them all at the same time.

00:05:27.530 --> 00:05:31.330
The moment I transfer them 
to my gullet and hatch them,

00:05:31.330 --> 00:05:34.900
I use a great deal of energy.

00:05:35.340 --> 00:05:39.970
It takes about 1500 kcals for each one.

00:05:39.970 --> 00:05:42.440
About the same number of calories burned

00:05:42.440 --> 00:05:45.780
by a 60-kg human running a 25-km marathon.

00:05:47.010 --> 00:05:49.420
In that case, your limit...

00:05:49.420 --> 00:05:50.580
I suppose...

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:53.650
...I might reach it after 1000 more or so!

00:05:53.650 --> 00:05:54.490
What?!

00:05:55.890 --> 00:06:00.090
Grasse Bee (Insect Beast) Capture Level 35

00:06:03.400 --> 00:06:06.470
Another 1000 more of these?!

00:06:28.950 --> 00:06:31.790
Granny Setsu, what are you doing?

00:06:31.790 --> 00:06:33.890
Can't you tell?

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:38.030
I'm making something delicious.

00:06:38.030 --> 00:06:42.270
More importantly, we have to hurry to 
Toriko and the others without delay!

00:06:42.270 --> 00:06:46.770
Toriko and Komatsu most 
definitely have power.

00:06:46.770 --> 00:06:49.740
My kitchen is off-limits to everyone, 
but I have such high hopes

00:06:49.740 --> 00:06:56.910
for the boys that I gave them a tour.

00:06:56.910 --> 00:07:01.450
Then you're saying there's 
no need to head to Ice Hell?

00:07:04.050 --> 00:07:05.020
I'll go.

00:07:05.020 --> 00:07:06.460
Wait!

00:07:09.060 --> 00:07:11.530
Now then, all finished!

00:07:12.860 --> 00:07:14.700
W-What in the world...

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:25.540
G-Gourmet Reviver?

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:33.450
What's the matter, Zonge-sama?

00:07:34.950 --> 00:07:38.650
He says "Gourmet Reviver? What in the...?"

00:07:38.650 --> 00:07:43.390
They preserve precious ingredients 
and revive their flavors.

00:07:43.690 --> 00:07:46.560
They revive and breed species 
that have gone extinct.

00:07:46.560 --> 00:07:48.030
They're a gourmet rescue squad

00:07:48.030 --> 00:07:51.030
for protecting the world's 
ingredients from drying up.

00:07:51.030 --> 00:07:54.600
They're just as important 
as the Gourmet Hunters.

00:07:54.600 --> 00:07:55.600
Right?

00:07:55.600 --> 00:07:58.710
Well, unlike most of the Gourmet Hunters,

00:07:58.710 --> 00:08:01.810
I don't work for a country or the IGO.

00:08:01.810 --> 00:08:03.950
I'm a freelance Gourmet Reviver.

00:08:03.950 --> 00:08:07.150
I thought you were quirky 
and kind of a weirdo,

00:08:07.150 --> 00:08:09.050
but I never realized you 
were a Gourmet Reviver!

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:09.820
And you are?

00:08:10.190 --> 00:08:11.620
Sorry for not introducing myself.

00:08:11.620 --> 00:08:13.960
My name is Komatsu.

00:08:13.960 --> 00:08:15.220
I'm a chef.

00:08:15.520 --> 00:08:19.460
A chef, huh? And since 
you're always with Toriko,

00:08:19.460 --> 00:08:21.200
I suppose you're his partner, right?

00:08:21.200 --> 00:08:23.430
You know Toriko-san?

00:08:23.430 --> 00:08:25.430
He's famous, after all.

00:08:25.430 --> 00:08:29.340
Well, not as famous as me, who 
has to go around in a mask.

00:08:29.340 --> 00:08:32.170
You wear a mask to conceal your identity?

00:08:32.170 --> 00:08:34.040
The goals of a Gourmet Hunter and

00:08:34.040 --> 00:08:35.940
Gourmet Reviver are total 
opposites, after all.

00:08:35.940 --> 00:08:38.210
Gourmet Hunters capture ingredients.

00:08:38.210 --> 00:08:40.410
Gourmet Revivers preserve ingredients!

00:08:40.410 --> 00:08:41.750
Exactly.

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:44.420
I can't have my identity known

00:08:44.420 --> 00:08:46.420
when I'm the only one with 
the opposite mission.

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:50.520
But why would you go all that 
way just to hide your identity?

00:08:50.960 --> 00:08:55.160
I came to investigate the Century Soup 
at the request of a certain person.

00:08:55.160 --> 00:08:58.600
As I feared, there's no 
broth left of the soup.

00:08:58.870 --> 00:09:03.340
The creatures in the Gourmet Show Window 
are all extinct, gone from this world.

00:09:03.740 --> 00:09:06.570
Even for me, reviving 
them would be difficult.

00:09:10.980 --> 00:09:12.280
It's you!

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:15.010
Oh, that's a Wall Penguin!

00:09:15.010 --> 00:09:16.850
Aren't they almost extinct?

00:09:19.350 --> 00:09:20.590
What's wrong?

00:09:20.590 --> 00:09:23.490
You finally reunited with your 
parents, so why are you here?

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:28.290
Could it be...

00:09:36.100 --> 00:09:40.310
You're... all alone now?

00:09:47.110 --> 00:09:48.150
What is it?

00:10:00.730 --> 00:10:02.230
It's the Aurora!

00:10:13.170 --> 00:10:15.970
If we can see the Aurora, then...

00:10:16.370 --> 00:10:17.710
Teppei-san!

00:10:18.340 --> 00:10:19.980
The soup is here!

00:10:19.980 --> 00:10:20.680
Really?

00:10:20.680 --> 00:10:23.750
Yeah! It's just a bit, 
but it's definitely here!

00:10:24.110 --> 00:10:25.380
Let's search for it!

00:10:25.380 --> 00:10:26.420
Yeah!

00:10:41.330 --> 00:10:43.330
W-What is it?

00:10:43.630 --> 00:10:45.540
Toriko and the others must be fighting.

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:48.000
Wait for us, Toriko-san.

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:50.670
We'll find the Century Soup, for sure!

00:11:02.120 --> 00:11:03.450
Tommy!

00:11:04.250 --> 00:11:08.760
Are you that unsure you 
can't beat me yourself?

00:11:09.260 --> 00:11:12.560
That's why you're using 
the insects, isn't it?

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:15.360
Are you that afraid of me?

00:11:15.600 --> 00:11:19.800
For someone called a Vice-Chef, 
you're quite the coward.

00:11:20.600 --> 00:11:23.810
Nice try, but provoking me 
isn't gonna work, Toriko.

00:11:23.810 --> 00:11:26.270
You will fight the insects, and that's all!

00:11:27.710 --> 00:11:30.610
After all, I'm simply after the soup.

00:11:30.610 --> 00:11:34.550
How I kill you doesn't matter one bit.

00:11:34.550 --> 00:11:38.220
Tommyrod... He's a tough one.

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:42.260
Cool and composed like an emotionless insect.

00:11:42.260 --> 00:11:45.230
He thinks only about getting 
the soup, and nothing else.

00:11:46.160 --> 00:11:49.800
I understand now why the 
Gourmet Corp. sent you

00:11:49.800 --> 00:11:53.030
to get this soup they're 
serious about getting.

00:11:58.340 --> 00:11:59.170
Toriko!

00:12:04.310 --> 00:12:06.710
Insects are alive, too!

00:12:06.710 --> 00:12:11.520
What the hell do you even 
think of their lives?!

00:12:17.320 --> 00:12:21.290
You give birth to a ton just 
as a way to do battle...

00:12:21.290 --> 00:12:26.970
Don't you care about all the life you 
put to waste for your own purposes?

00:12:36.040 --> 00:12:39.510
No, I don't care about this trash!

00:12:40.080 --> 00:12:48.620
All the useless dead ones are just trash!

00:12:52.060 --> 00:12:54.130
So I have no choice but to fight...

00:12:54.430 --> 00:12:57.630
5-Fold Spiked Punch!

00:13:00.770 --> 00:13:03.030
Flying Fork!

00:13:05.770 --> 00:13:07.870
Flying Knife!

00:13:16.610 --> 00:13:18.880
Crap, there's too many!

00:13:19.880 --> 00:13:21.850
I-I'm...

00:13:40.170 --> 00:13:43.540
Toriko!

00:14:23.650 --> 00:14:24.580
What?

00:14:27.320 --> 00:14:29.920
What was that just now? A vision?

00:14:32.650 --> 00:14:36.290
My limit of 1000 insects.

00:14:36.290 --> 00:14:39.930
Looks like even you couldn't 
stop them all, huh?

00:14:42.160 --> 00:14:43.830
Take that!

00:14:43.830 --> 00:14:48.940
Just sit there and become 
food for the insects, Toriko!

00:14:55.440 --> 00:15:00.580
Seems 1000 at once really does use 
up a serious amount of my energy.

00:15:01.150 --> 00:15:05.250
I can't use up any more of my stamina.

00:15:05.250 --> 00:15:09.020
Gotta keep this guy under 
control, after all...

00:15:23.200 --> 00:15:24.740
Small fry.

00:15:24.740 --> 00:15:27.270
You sure about not killing me?

00:15:30.040 --> 00:15:34.650
Unless you make sure to kill 
even the smallest of rat,

00:15:34.650 --> 00:15:38.920
they'll one day grow into a 
tiger and come for your neck.

00:15:38.920 --> 00:15:42.190
Oh? But I'm already killing you.

00:15:45.560 --> 00:15:49.130
Your life is nothing to me.

00:15:53.030 --> 00:15:56.740
Make sure to kill, huh?

00:15:58.900 --> 00:16:02.270
Is he really dead?

00:16:02.810 --> 00:16:06.210
If I want to make sure of getting the soup,

00:16:06.210 --> 00:16:09.650
I can't ignore whether 
Toriko is alive or dead.

00:16:09.880 --> 00:16:12.920
Why is he still on his 
knees? Why won't he fall?

00:16:13.590 --> 00:16:16.920
I must completely eliminate 
anything that could prevent me

00:16:16.920 --> 00:16:21.860
from capturing the soup, even 
if it's only a 1% chance!

00:16:22.390 --> 00:16:26.730
In the end, I can't be certain 
just with the insects...

00:16:28.900 --> 00:16:32.440
I'll kill him with my own 
hands, just to be sure!

00:16:32.440 --> 00:16:35.240
I'll throw you so deep into the pits of hell

00:16:35.240 --> 00:16:37.980
you'll never rise up again, Toriko!

00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:09.510
Finally, you got close to me, Tommyrod!

00:17:09.510 --> 00:17:11.740
W-What?!

00:17:11.740 --> 00:17:13.710
You're invited...

00:17:13.710 --> 00:17:19.720
...to this Ice Hell! But not for me...

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:21.880
For you!

00:17:24.950 --> 00:17:28.690
Spiked Punch... 10-Fold!

00:18:04.760 --> 00:18:07.960
Finally managed to land one on you.

00:18:11.600 --> 00:18:14.900
Well, more accurately, 10.

00:18:14.900 --> 00:18:16.240
Toriko!

00:18:16.240 --> 00:18:19.940
How did you escape the insects' attacks?

00:18:20.610 --> 00:18:22.880
Can't you feel anything?

00:18:23.140 --> 00:18:25.610
It can't be... This smell is...

00:18:26.110 --> 00:18:29.420
Essential oil?!

00:18:31.150 --> 00:18:33.190
Essential oil...

00:18:33.550 --> 00:18:36.290
A fragrant oil produced by plants...

00:18:37.420 --> 00:18:40.060
The insects have been slowed down!

00:18:40.060 --> 00:18:42.700
This is phytoncide?

00:18:43.260 --> 00:18:45.870
A substance that plants 
produce to protect themselves

00:18:45.870 --> 00:18:51.140
by killing insects eating 
its leaves or trunks!

00:18:51.140 --> 00:18:56.410
Toriko's body, on the brink of death 
from being attacked by 1000 insects,

00:18:56.410 --> 00:18:59.480
started to produce phytoncide!

00:18:59.480 --> 00:19:03.980
The Gourmet Cell's instincts of 
self-preservation are at work here?

00:19:03.980 --> 00:19:07.520
Phytoncide is damaging to insects,

00:19:07.520 --> 00:19:10.860
but for the body itself it's 
a very gentle substance.

00:19:11.790 --> 00:19:15.490
So the healing and kind 
feeling of a forest I felt

00:19:15.490 --> 00:19:17.930
was because of the phytoncide?

00:19:20.000 --> 00:19:23.800
You fought well. Thank you.

00:19:26.040 --> 00:19:30.640
Toriko appreciated our hard-fought battles.

00:19:31.240 --> 00:19:37.050
Did I sense that smell coming 
from his body even back then?

00:19:37.880 --> 00:19:40.080
The healing atmosphere Toriko emits

00:19:40.080 --> 00:19:43.350
is the same scent as a 
forest that insects hate.

00:19:43.620 --> 00:19:48.490
Toriko's instincts, remembering the 
fierceness of Tommyrod's insects' attacks,

00:19:48.490 --> 00:19:51.660
produced this substance to protect itself.

00:19:52.230 --> 00:19:56.100
Toriko's Gourmet Cells, faced with death,

00:19:56.100 --> 00:19:58.800
produced this substance 
as much as they could.

00:19:59.100 --> 00:20:02.970
The phytoncide, which smells 
much like essential oil,

00:20:02.970 --> 00:20:06.140
was secreted out of his entire body...

00:20:07.010 --> 00:20:12.020
Essential oil... A healing 
fragrance used for aromatherapy.

00:20:12.520 --> 00:20:16.150
So it was the healing power of that fragrance

00:20:16.150 --> 00:20:19.520
which caused me to see the 
vision of the beautiful forest?

00:20:19.820 --> 00:20:25.630
Furthermore, phytoncide is spread 
from tree to tree within a forest.

00:20:25.630 --> 00:20:29.130
So even just a small amount of the smell

00:20:29.300 --> 00:20:32.970
has transferred to me and 
slowed the insects down?

00:20:33.270 --> 00:20:36.610
And with this, the insects 
will no longer attack!

00:20:36.610 --> 00:20:40.840
It's just you and me, Tommyrod!

00:20:43.680 --> 00:20:45.350
Prepare yourself.

00:20:45.350 --> 00:20:48.020
From now on, it's no-holds-barred.

00:20:48.020 --> 00:20:53.460
When I go really wild, I'm not 
the kind man you've seen so far!

00:20:53.460 --> 00:20:55.320
You fool!

00:20:55.320 --> 00:20:59.490
How dare you drip that 
scent I hate most of all!

00:21:10.370 --> 00:21:14.610
I'm grumble-grumble hungry! 
My tummy's rumble rumblin'!

00:21:15.680 --> 00:21:18.880
Today we're out there: Ack 
SOS, I'm in trouble yes!

00:21:18.880 --> 00:21:22.220
Gotta go! Gotta go! Can't 
leave this alone, right?

00:21:22.520 --> 00:21:25.690
Giving you support and cheer, 
the duties are endless!

00:21:25.690 --> 00:21:29.060
Burnin' up! Bustin' out! Trouble buster!

00:21:29.060 --> 00:21:32.130
Oh my god! A heaping helping of energy!

00:21:32.130 --> 00:21:35.900
When I'm hungry I can't get any power!

00:21:35.900 --> 00:21:39.470
Go, fight! At attention to you!

00:21:39.470 --> 00:21:42.600
Two-way communication!

00:21:42.600 --> 00:21:46.110
The encouragement I get 
from you is my nourishment!

00:21:46.370 --> 00:21:49.880
I want to eat lots of delicious things!

00:21:49.880 --> 00:21:53.250
Our future looks to be tasty!

00:21:53.250 --> 00:21:55.080
Right? OK. Left? OK.

00:21:55.080 --> 00:21:59.790
Be careful, courageously! Right on, let's go!

00:21:59.790 --> 00:22:03.360
Fight with bravery!

00:22:03.360 --> 00:22:07.060
Deli-deli delicious, and let's eat!

00:22:11.560 --> 00:22:13.700
Gourmet News!

00:22:15.300 --> 00:22:17.000
I'm your host, Tina!

00:22:17.000 --> 00:22:21.440
Toriko fights even without his Lighter 
Suit in the freezing depths of Ice Hell!

00:22:21.440 --> 00:22:24.380
For us normal humans who can't use Shivering,

00:22:24.380 --> 00:22:27.310
eating a warm meal is most important!

00:22:27.310 --> 00:22:33.050
And so, I'll introduce you a way to taste 
the most classic dish to warm you up!

00:22:34.750 --> 00:22:37.060
Into a curry-flavored cup noodle...

00:22:39.320 --> 00:22:41.830
...mix in a cup of milk coffee!

00:22:44.100 --> 00:22:45.930
Let's eat!

00:22:54.310 --> 00:22:56.010
It tastes like beef stew!

00:22:56.340 --> 00:22:59.380
It tastes so delicious, I'm moo-ved!

00:22:59.780 --> 00:23:02.180
I think I just started Shivering myself!

00:23:02.880 --> 00:23:04.720
Now, on to the next story!

